2026-03-24T15:09:40Z [INFO] gbif.agent | process.log | message=Top results | data={'results': [{'id': '51cfe5c9-7826-3ce5-be8d-e37a5c624bf4', 'title': 'Bio‐invasion of Aquatic Invasive Species in India', 'year': 2021, 'literatureType': 'BOOK_SECTION', 'source': 'Invasive Alien Species', 'authors': ['None Ramakrishna'], 'openAccess': True, 'peerReview': False, 'doi_url': 'https://doi.org/10.1002/9781119607045.ch15'}, {'id': '7459b444-9c66-337a-b249-e37b15a8f70f', 'title': 'Modeling potential invasion range of alien invasive species, Hyptis suaveolens (L.) Poit. in India: Comparison of MaxEnt and GARP', 'year': 2014, 'literatureType': 'JOURNAL', 'source': 'Ecological Informatics', 'authors': ['Hitendra Padalia', 'Vivek Srivastava', 'S.P.S. Kushwaha'], 'openAccess': False, 'peerReview': True, 'doi_url': 'https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecoinf.2014.04.002'}, {'id': 'de3154bd-6dec-31a3-8f91-46a1ba8a62d6', 'title': 'India needs trade regulatory policies to manage invasive alien species', 'year': 2024, 'literatureType': 'GENERIC', 'source': 'BIOINVASION: EIACP Newsletter on Biological Invasions', 'authors': ['Achyut Kumar Banerjee'], 'openAccess': False, 'peerReview': False, 'doi_url': None}]}
2026-03-24T15:09:40Z [INFO] gbif.agent | process.create_artifact | args=() | kwargs={'mimetype': 'application/json', 'description': 'Literature records related to invasive species in India.', 'uris': ['https://api.gbif.org/v1/literature/search?q=invasive+species&countriesOfCoverage=IN&limit=20&export=true'], 'metadata': {'portal_url': 'https://www.gbif.org/resource/search?contentType=literature&q=invasive+species&countriesOfCoverage=IN&export=true', 'data_source': 'GBIF Literature'}}
